      "insight": "Readers click Bitcoin treasury stories not to celebrate adoption but to stress-test the model — the highest engagement clusters around macro threats, debt-funded accumulation risk, and government rejection, revealing that the audience is actively auditing whether corporate BTC treasuries are a durable strategy or a leveraged bet dressed up as treasury management.",
