      "rows": [
        {
          "dimension": "Market / Price",
          "level": "High",
          "note": "Leveraged treasury firms face existential balance-sheet risk if BTC drops to the $70K range flagged by analysts like Arthur Hayes, potentially triggering forced liquidations across the sector.",
