        },
        {
          "dimension": "Structural / Ponzi dynamics",
          "level": "High",
          "note": "Continuous equity and debt issuance to fund BTC purchases depends on share-price premiums to NAV that collapse in a bear market, echoing pre-2008 CDO self-reinforcing structures.",
